sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Manage profile and preferences
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7
    %% Description: A user saves personal and payment details, states preferred genres and event types, and keeps the profile up to date.
    actor UP as User (person)
    participant U as User
    participant GE as Genre
    participant ET as EventType

    %% covers 1
    UP->>U: save personal information
    %% covers 2
    UP->>U: save payment details
    %% covers 3
    UP->>U: fill out preference survey
    U->>GE: preferred genres
    U->>ET: preferred event types
    %% covers 5, 7
    UP->>U: edit preferences and personal information
    %% covers 6
    UP->>U: change password
